WEBVTT

00:10:28.546 --> 00:10:30.380
While our body is still

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:33.451
and our mind is off walking in dreams somewhere,

00:10:33.451 --> 00:10:35.127
the elegant machinery of the brain

00:10:35.127 --> 00:10:37.107
is quietly hard at work

00:10:37.107 --> 00:10:39.300
cleaning and maintaining

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:42.135
this unimaginably complex machine.

00:10:42.135 --> 00:10:43.176
Like our housework,

00:10:43.176 --> 00:10:45.925
it's a dirty and a thankless job,

00:10:45.925 --> 00:10:48.180
but it's also important.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:50.583
In your house, if you stop cleaning your kitchen

00:10:50.583 --> 00:10:52.491
for a month,

00:10:52.491 --> 00:10:54.930
your home will become completely unlivable

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:56.537
very quickly.

00:10:56.537 --> 00:10:58.625
But in the brain, the consequences

00:10:58.625 --> 00:11:01.556
of falling behind may be much greater